 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Ongoing action",
   "texto": [
    "**-고 있어요** presenta una acción en desarrollo: 먹다 → **먹고 있어요** (estoy comiendo), 공부하다 → **공부하고 있어요** (estoy estudiando), 자다 → **자고 있어요** (está durmiendo). It is common with **지금**, but the context can also make the moment clear."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Front to - - -",
   "texto": [
    "The present **-아/어요** can talk about current habits or situations: **매일 공부해요** = study every day; **지금 공부해요** can also mean «study now». **-고 있어요** points out that the action is ongoing: **지금 공부하고 있어요** = I am now studying. Do not mechanically translate all forms into - ∞ / ∞ - as a habit."
   ]
  },
